+---
+id: TASK-31421
+title: >-
+  Library skills browse: loading/ready settlement race can drop a correct focus restore
+status: To Do
+assignee: []
+created_date: '2026-09-04 00:00'
+updated_date: '2026-09-04 00:00'
+labels:
+  - skills
